Supplemental source notices for tesseract.js-core 7.0.0

The npm package supplies its Apache-2.0 LICENSE but not the native dependency
license files. These original source notices supplement that package license
for its LSTM WebAssembly builds (scalar, SIMD and relaxed SIMD).

Source provenance:
https://github.com/naptha/tesseract.js-core/tree/v7.0.0/third_party
https://github.com/naptha/tesseract.js-core/blob/v7.0.0/build.sh
https://github.com/naptha/tesseract.js-core/blob/v7.0.0/build-scripts/build-leptonica.sh
https://github.com/naptha/tesseract.js-core/blob/v7.0.0/build-with-docker.sh

The pinned build scripts build Tesseract, Leptonica, GIF, JPEG, PNG, TIFF,
WebP, zlib and openlibm as static dependencies. The Docker build names
Emscripten 4.0.15. The files below retain upstream contents unchanged.
Some local filenames differ so that license aggregation also includes upstream
README and PATENTS files; each original path is identified explicitly.

