Scope of this supplement

This is an inventory of notices identified from the pinned upstream source
build, not a complete or independently reproduced binary SBOM. The published
npm WebAssembly artifacts have not been rebuilt and compared byte for byte,
and no complete link map or file-level inventory of compiler/runtime code is
claimed. An upstream source license can cover files omitted by that build;
this inventory does not assert that every file or optional feature is linked.
The trained language models have separate notices in ../tessdata-fast.
